    "plan_update_summary": "### Cycle #20 Quantitative Adjustment\nWhile DeepSeek V4.1 Flash transitioned the desk into net profitability (PF 1.1, Net P&L \u20b9+8.68), fee drag consumed nearly 80% of gross profits and tight stop-losses (0.55%) resulted in frequent mid-morning whipsaws across high-beta names like TATASTEEL. To harden the strategy against Indian mid-session microstructure noise and statutory fee drag, we are widening `min_sl_pct` to 0.65% to give setups breathing room, raising `min_sweep_vol_multiplier` to 2.45x to demand true institutional participation, tightening `breakeven_trigger_r` to 1.00R to lock in fee-adjusted capital protection earlier, and expanding `min_target_pct` to 1.45% to preserve positive asymmetric risk-reward."
